    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but it just feels like a lot of unnecessary struggle. if every last thing we build or feel is just going to be erased by the vacuum anyway, then why do we have to endure the struggle of being alive at all? it feels like we're just forcing ourselves to keep going through all this pain for a movie that's eventually going to be deleted. wouldn't it be more logical to just accept the nothingness and stop fighting it?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
